            <p class="Division"><a name="3.08.001"></a>DIVISION 3-08-001<br />ADULT ORIENTED BUSINESSES</p>


            <p class="digCH">SECTIONS:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0308001.html#3.08.001.0001">3-08-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PURPOSE AND FINDINGS</p>

