            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0308001.html#3.08.001.0018">3-08-001-0018</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ADDITIONAL OPERATIONAL REQUIREMENTS FOR ADULT ORIENTED BUSINESSES</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0308001.html#3.08.001.0019">3-08-001-0019</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PROHIBITION AGAINST CHILDREN IN A SEXUALLY ORIENTED BUSINESS AND DUTY TO INSPECT OUTSIDE A SEXUALLY ORIENTED BUSINESS</p>

